# 3.6 GB of raw reservation data. Untracked AND unignored until 2026-08-05,
# so a stray `git add .` would have staged the lot into the repo.
reservations2024/

# Telemetry (Project D). The glob covers the WAL and shared-memory sidecars.
data/telemetry.db*

# Dev scratch at the repo root: screenshots and captured API responses.
# Root-anchored so app/static/ images are unaffected.
/*.png
/permit_*.json
/ridb_swagger.yaml

# Local-only — kept out of the shared repo (development docs, AI instructions).
# `tests/` and `pytest.ini` were removed from history in the 2026-06-13 scrub and
# restored 2026-08-13: a collaborator cloning this repo silently got no test
# suite, so regression tests could not travel with a PR. The duplicate-alert fix
# (#3) shipped with three tests that were invisible in its diff for that reason.
CLAUDE.md
docs/
